            <ArticleTitle>Pain management for dermatologic procedures in children.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>287-307; discussion 308</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Simple explanations provided to children and their parents before a dermatologic procedure is attempted will decrease the time it takes to perform the procedure and make it a less difficult experience for all concerned. The dermatologist should always consider the availability of less painful but effective methods when treating children.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
